#: web-components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and using\n"
"framework-agnostic custom elements from\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` classes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box), and `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registers elements like "
"`<instui-icon>`), then\n"
"  renders markup into `#app`.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — replace their contents with your own markup.\n"
"- Use custom elements directly in markup, e.g. `<instui-button>`, `<instui-"
"alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  see the [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for the full element list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Vite를 통해 만든 순수 TypeScript 앱으로, [`@pantoken/components`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components)로 스타일링되어 있으며\n"
"프레임워크에 구애받지 않는 커스텀 엘리먼트를 [`@pantoken/web-components`]"
"(https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-components)에서 사용합니다.\n"
"\n"
"## 개발\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## 내용물\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts`는 `@pantoken/css`를 임포트합니다 (모든 `--instui-*` 커스텀 속"
"성을 정의함),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` 클래스"
"들),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (모달, 툴팁 및 기타 컴포넌트 동작을 즉시 연결함), "
"그리고 `@pantoken/web-components` ( `<instui-icon>` 같은 엘리먼트를 자동 등"
"록),\n"
"  그런 다음 `#app`에 마크업을 렌더링합니다.\n"
"- 선택적 삽입 지점(header, filters, content, trailing)은 `<div data-"
"slot=\"...\">`로 표시되어 있습니다 — 해당 내용물을 직접 만든 마크업으로 교체"
"하세요.\n"
"- 마크업에서 커스텀 엘리먼트를 직접 사용하세요. 예: `<instui-button>`, "
"`<instui-alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  전체 엘리먼트 목록은 [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-components)를 참조하세요.\n"
"\n"
"## 더 알아보기\n"
"\n"
"자세한 내용은 [HTML 가이드](https://pantoken.app/guide/components)를 참조하세"
"요.\n"
